  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you click and drag a scrolling UI element and you move the cursor outside of the game window then release the left mouse button, the scrolling element remains 'stuck' to the mouse until you click again.\nRepro (100% of the time):\n1. Run VRChat in desktop mode in a window.\n2. Click and drag on any scrolling UI element (e.g. Favourite Avatars list), drag the cursor outside the game window, and release the left mouse button once the cursor is outside the game window.\n3. Observe, the UI element remains stuck to the mouse as if you were still holding left-click.\nIt's quite annoying when playing in a small window e.g. when working with Unity and the SDK at the same time as running VRChat.",
